  "comments": "Varieties can be found as illustrated below.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - wide epaulette, signature FR. Thenot under the sash of the Legion of Merit of Chile, left medal (for observer to the right) on a ring, wide rim.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span> - wide epaulette, signature under the sash, left medal on a ring. <span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Note.</span> Part of mintage was struck with grounded die.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span> - wide epaulette, signature under the sash, medals almost incused, left medal with additional ray at bottom.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span> - wide epaulette with circle, signature under the sash, left medal on a bow, tall script to LIBERTADOR B.O&#039;HIGGINS.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">5</span> - small portrait, narrow epaulette and the sash, medals stylized, no signature under the sash.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Notes</span>. 1. Part of mintage in 2012 was struck with die <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">5</span> wide rim.<br />\r\n2. Additional features of lettering shown on images. Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/619b44cd6410f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/619b44cd6410f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"194\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - PE smaller than S to PESOS, fine script, wide rim.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - PE smaller than S to PESOS, fine script.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span> - PE smaller than S to PESOS, bold script.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span> - PE same size as S to PESOS, bold script.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">E</span> - PE same size as S to PESOS, serifs to PE with right angles.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Notes.</span> 1. Part of mintage was struck with grounded dies.<br />\r\n2. Additional features of lettering shown on images. Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/619b45143a4cb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/619b45143a4cb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"74\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Edge</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">a</span> - 23.5 grooves/cm.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span> - 27 grooves/cm.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">c</span> - 25 grooves/cm.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e80bf5b920d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e80bf5b920d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"94\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">a</span>: 1990.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">a</span>: 1990.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">a</span>: 1990-2002.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">a</span>: 2002-2006.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span>: 2004-2009.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">c</span>: 2007 Ottawa.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">a</span>: 2010.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span>: 2010.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">5</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span>: 2010.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">5</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">E</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span>: 2011, 2012 (both rims on Obv.), 2013, 2014 So, 2014 Utrect, 2015 So, 2015 Utrect, 2016, 2017.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">5</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">E</span>: 2019.<br /><br /><br />\r\n1990:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e7fd52f3e3a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e7fd52f3e3a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"158\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2000:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e80140a958d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e80140a958d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"111\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2002:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e807e230432.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e807e230432.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"123\" /></a><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e80aa1e0a3b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e80aa1e0a3b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"99\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2010:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e8146eb8b2b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e8146eb8b2b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"111\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2011:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e8147cd8cb5.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e8147cd8cb5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"103\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2012:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e8107b55ac7.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e8107b55ac7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"110\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2014-2015:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e811774a05a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e811774a05a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"109\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2015:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5c101d5945fb6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5c101d5945fb6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"104\" /></a>",
